<title>USA: Ripon, Wis., won by Juran &amp; Moody.</title>
<headline>Ripon, Wis., won by Juran &amp; Moody.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juran &amp; Moody, Inc said it won $1.605 million of Ripon, Wis., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series 1997A, with a true interest cost of 5.20 percent.</p>
